{"sym":"COP","v":2,"about":{"summary":"ConocoPhillips explores for, produces, transports, and markets crude oil, bitumen, natural gas, liquefied natural gas (LNG), and natural gas liquids. It operates in five segments: Alaska; Lower 48; Canada; Europe, Middle East and North Africa; and Asia Pacific. The company's portfolio includes unconventional plays in North America; conventional assets in North America, Europe, Asia, and Australia; global LNG developments; oil sands assets in Canada; and an inventory of global exploration prospects. It serves in the United States, Canada, China, Equatorial Guinea, Libya, Malaysia, Norway, Singapore, the United Kingdom, and internationally. ConocoPhillips was founded in 1917 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","lead":"ConocoPhillips explores for, produces, transports, and markets crude oil, bitumen, natural gas, liquefied natural gas (LNG), and natural gas liquids. It operates in five segments: Alaska; Lower 48; Canada; Europe, Middle East and North Africa; and Asia Pacific.","web":"https://www.conocophillips.com","ir":"http://www.conocophillips.com/investor-relations/Pages/default.aspx","emp":9600,"city":"Houston","state":"TX","country":"United States"},"officers":[{"n":"Mr. Ryan M. Lance","t":"Executive Chair of the Board","age":63,"yb":1962,"pay":6906700,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Andrew M. O'Brien","t":"President, CEO & Director","age":50,"yb":1975,"pay":2170900,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Kirk L. Johnson","t":"Executive Vice President of Global Operations & Technical Functions","age":49,"yb":1976,"pay":2150700,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Nicholas G. Olds","t":"Executive Vice President of Lower 48 & Global HSE","age":55,"yb":1970,"pay":2784200,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Kontessa S. Haynes-Welsh","t":"Senior VP of Digital and Transformation & CFO","age":50,"yb":1975,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Guy Allen Baber IV, CPA","t":"Vice President of Investor Relations","fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Shannon Browning Kinney","t":"Senior VP of Legal, General Counsel & Corpor